@18755 = ~The new *Armageddon Tester's Sword(tm) deals 20d20 + 50 pts damage crushing and slashing. Plus: 100 Lore bonus; huge THACO bonus; sets STR to 26; Sets DEX to 26; +10 to AC bonus; Increased movement rate; and much, much more to make critical path less painful and more brutal. "

"Another great, over-the-top, rediculously powerful weapon by Sir Hairy Peanut."

STATISTICS:

Damage:  20D20 + 50
Attack Bonus: +10 
Damage Type:  Slashing/Crushing
Special:
  Haste - weilder is hasted.
  Strength - sets STR to 26
  Dexterity - sets DEX to 26
"  Immunities - immune to fire, electricity, acid, poison"
  Magic Resistance - 100
  2D10 Acid damage per hit.
  Regenration - 10 hp per round
  AC bonus - +10
  Speed bonus - +3 attacks
  Usable by all classes
  
Weight:  9
Speed Factor: 5
Proficiency Type: Great Swords
Type:  1-handed

"*This item is not to be used to test play balance. Those who use this item to test play balance will be subject to a vicious beating, followed by 48 hours straight of watching ""The Facts of Life"" reruns.~
